module experiment.realtime_auction_arena.win32_auctioneer.main
purpose module experiment.realtime_auction_arena.win32_auctioneer.main "Native Win32 auctioneer operator-console scaffold for Realtime Auction Arena."
moduleOwns experiment.realtime_auction_arena.win32_auctioneer.main "The standard.gui window composition, control handles, and synchronous event handlers for visible operator-console actions."
moduleDoesNotOwn experiment.realtime_auction_arena.win32_auctioneer.main "Server API behavior, native HTTP POST/header support, async UI dispatch, SSE subscriptions, or packaging resource embedding."
invariant module experiment.realtime_auction_arena.win32_auctioneer.main "Handlers keep the GUI responsive by updating status/list controls immediately and leave unsupported network behavior as explicit runtime-gap status text."
moduleWarning experiment.realtime_auction_arena.win32_auctioneer.main "This is a parseable GUI scaffold. The current runtime can create basic Win32 controls, but authenticated HTTP writes and background polling are blocked by standard.net/standard.gui integration gaps."

import gui standard.gui

entry console main
exportOperation experiment.realtime_auction_arena.win32_auctioneer.main main

